  - Composition (web GlassPanel + <h2> + Grid[RadialGauge ×3 + Badge]):
      • GlassPanel  -> TSGlassPanel.
      • <h2> title  -> always-visible header, web t('dynamics.liveMotor','Live Motor Status').
      • RadialGauge -> native ring (track + accent arc fills clamped/max) + centre value
                       (fmtNumber(clamped, isInteger?0:precision) + unit) + label + caption
                       span; torque #3b82f6→chartSeriesSpeed, RPM #a855f7→chartSeriesPower,
                       temp #f59e0b→statusWarning (token sRGB == web hex exactly).
      • Torque gauge-> value=(torque_nm_front??0)+(torque_nm_rear??0), max 1000, "Nm",
                       caption `${fmtNumber(total)} Nm` (default precision).
      • RPM gauge   -> value=motor_rpm_front??0, max 18000, "RPM", caption
                       `${fmtNumber(rpm,0)} RPM`.
      • Temp gauge  -> motorTempC=max(front??-Inf,rear??-Inf); display=isFinite?conv:0,
                       max 200, unit=tempUnit; caption `${fmtNumber(conv,1)}${tempUnit}`
                       OR t('dynamics.awaiting','Awaiting data') when neither axle reports.
      • Shift badge -> Badge variant success(shift=='D')/neutral + gearshape.fill glyph +
                       (shift_state ?? t('dynamics.unknown','Unknown')) over the
                       t('dynamics.shiftState','Shift State') caption.
  - States (ALL rendered, each with a #if DEBUG preview + a model/view test):
      loading (skeleton ring grid) · empty (web EmptyState
